{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up, demon! You are trapped in a surreal freak show where space itself wants to destroy you. From above, from the bottomless darkness, giant cubes are inexorably falling - symbols of pure, soulless order, seeking to erase your chaotic essence. Each floor is a new arena for a deadly ballet. Jump, slide, roll - do everything to avoid a fatal blow. Your salvation is in constant movement and searching for the nearest door to the next platform, where only a new round of madness awaits. Save yourself or be crushed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Laugh - 2d platformer with puzzle elements. The player needs to move and jump on falling cubes to climb to inaccessible heights and enter the door to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912160?t=1757799212","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3912160?t=1757799212","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912160/5f2ed8b6fc83c6c9ab1516b1c0da0cdb42505b60/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757799212","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912160/5f2ed8b6fc83c6c9ab1516b1c0da0cdb42505b60/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757799212","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wake up, demon! You are trapped in a surreal freak show where space itself wants to destroy you. From above, from the bottomless darkness, giant cubes are inexorably falling - symbols of pure, soulless order, seeking to erase your chaotic essence. Each floor is a new arena for a deadly ballet. Jump, slide, roll - do everything to avoid a fatal blow. Your salvation is in constant movement and searching for the nearest door to the next platform, where only a new round of madness awaits. Save yourself or be crushed!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Devil Laugh - 2d platformer with puzzle elements. The player needs to move and jump on falling cubes to climb to inaccessible heights and enter the door to the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Beautiful pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Musical style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- High Difficulty</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Responsive Controls</p>","developers":["Esemte Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3912160/f289a50d6927efbd8ee6bc909c3a6a31454d550a/header.jpg?t=1757799212","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257175321,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175321/movie480.mp4?t=1757799210","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175321/movie_max.mp4?t=1757799210"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175321/11e6f27c92be9fe1a3d2e61d709b8844a5972530/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757799210","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175321/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1757799210","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257175321/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1757799210"}}],"name":"Devil Laugh","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows XP, 7, 8, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 5500U or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Gra